<title>UK: Shell Stanlow crude units back Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Shell Stanlow crude units back Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both crude distillation units at Shell's Stanlow refinery are expected to resume production later on Tuesday, a company spokesman said.  </p>
<p>The spokesman said the two units had been put on &quot;standby&quot; late on Monday due to steam leaking from the boiler unit.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7456</p>
</text>
